        " photon sectors."}], "Notes", CellID -> 870078728], 
     Cell[TextData[{"For displacement associations, block multiplication adds \
displacement vectors. Supply a complete directed-hopping association when \
needed to represent a Hermitian model."}], "Notes", CellID -> 483172806], 
     Cell[TextData[{"For scattering-region input, block multiplication \
contracts layer indices. If the effective result contains nonzero couplings \
between nonadjacent layers, the implementation emits a message and returns ", 
        Cell[BoxData[ButtonBox["$Failed", BaseStyle -> "Link", 
           ButtonData -> "paclet:ref/$Failed"]], "InlineFormula", 
         FontFamily -> "Source Sans Pro"], 
        " because the two-list form cannot represent them."}], "Notes", 
      CellID -> 342267340], Cell[TextData[{"The options ", 
        Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"\"ExpansionOrder\"", "\[Rule]", "1"}]], 
         "InlineFormula", FontFamily -> "Source Sans Pro"], " and ", 
